        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Tobin Estate Agents are delighted to present for sale this truly excellent brick built four bedroom detached dormer style residence.\r\nMuch sought-after location just 300m off the R178 (Shercock Road) circa 3km from Carrickmacross town on a site of 0.65 acres measure.\r\nRecently new upgraded Nobilia designer kitchen and utility along with quality sanitary ware and host of additional extras and features.\r\n\r\nFeatures include: O.F.C.H ,  u.P.V.C. double glazed windows and doors, new designer kitchen & utility, window blinds, quality sanitary ware, maintenance free exterior, patio area, wrought iron gates, tarmac driveway,  landscaped gardens, southwest facing rear gardens, patio area, 3km from Carrickmacross, floor area 220m², BER B3.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises: Entrance Hallway: 5.8m x 2.7m, Sitting room 5.5m x 4.6m, Kitchen / dining: 8.3m x 5.5m, Sunroom: 3.3m x 3m, Guest w.c.: 2m x 1.4m; Utility: 2.8m x 2.6m, Bedroom 4: 4.3m x 4.1m, Landing: 3m x 2.5m, Bathroom: 5.4m x 3.2m, Master Bedroom: 5.7m x 4.9m, Ensuite: 3.1m x 3.7m, Bedroom 2: 4.2m x 4m, Bedroom 3: 4.3m x 3.2m,"
      },
